<title>USA: McKesson in contract with Western Drug.</title>
<headline>McKesson in contract with Western Drug.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>McKesson Corp said it entered a five-year, prime-vendor supply agreement with Western Drug Distributors Inc, which owns the 20-store Drug Emporium chain in Washington and Oregon.</p>
<p>It said the contract is expected to result in new sales of more than $160 million over the term of the agreement.</p>
</text>
